/* Default Classic Rexx profile for the Regina build of THE.
   cREXX compiler tools remain optional; profile_crexx.the belongs to the
   CREXX build and adds its compiler workflow and diagnostics. */
address THE
'set cmdarrows tab'
'define s-tab cursor home save'
'define backspace sos delback'
'define ins insertmode toggle'
'define f5 insertmode toggle'
'set prefix gap 1'
'msg Welcome to THE - Regina macros'
